rem Numbers for which no three
rem consecutive digits have a sum
rem greater than a given value
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=164
rem Count the numbers of Digits digits,
rem no leading zero, where every three
rem digits in a row sum to at most Cap

use linalg
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Digits integer = 20
option Cap integer = 9

rem State (p, q): the last two digits as
rem 10 p + q. Appending r is allowed
rem when p + q + r <= Cap and moves to
rem state (q, r). Step a count vector
rem with the transition matrix.
S = 0 till 100 array
P = (S // 10) reshape 100 1
Q = (S mod 10) reshape 100 1
R = (0 till 10 array) reshape 1 10
Ok = P + Q + R at most Cap
To = Q * 10 + R
From = S reshape 100 1
Flat = From * 100 + To
Tm = array shape 10000 fill 0
Tm (Flat filter Ok array) = 1
Mat = Tm reshape 100 100
Start = S greater 9
V = Start choose 1 0
for Step in 3 to Digits
  V = V Mat matmul
end
Answer = V sum
Answer print
